# Notes Convention

`notes/` holds brief personal summaries of what Gleb knows (e.g. `lec1.md`).

## When solving tasks

- Open and use matching notes before explaining or coding.
- Align terminology and examples with the notes.
- If notes contradict a solution, trust current correct practice and flag the mismatch briefly.

## When editing notes

- Edit only if Gleb asks (e.g. "допиши в конспект", "исправь notes").
- Keep the same terse style: bullets, formulas, short snippets — no lecture rewrite.
- Prefer additive updates (new bullets) over rewriting existing text unless asked to clean up.
